@host = http://localhost:5160
@authToken = <your-jwt-token-here>
@sessionUid = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@sessionId = 1
@userId = 1

### 1. Obtener sesiones del usuario
GET {{host}}/api/session?userId={{userId}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Obtener solo sesiones activas del usuario
GET {{host}}/api/session?userId={{userId}}&activeOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Obtener una sesión por UID
GET {{host}}/api/session/{{sessionUid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Iniciar sesión de entrenamiento
POST {{host}}/api/session/start
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "boardId": null,
  "climbZoneId": 1,
  "mountainRouteId": null,
  "notes": "Sesión de escalada en roca, enfocada en técnica"
}

###

### 5. Iniciar sesión en board
POST {{host}}/api/session/start
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "boardId": 1,
  "climbZoneId": null,
  "mountainRouteId": null,
  "notes": "Sesión de boulder en board"
}

###

### 6. Finalizar sesión
PUT {{host}}/api/session/{{sessionUid}}/end?notes=Muy+buena+sesión
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 7. Registrar progreso en la sesión
POST {{host}}/api/session/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userSessionId": 1,
  "climbRouteId": 5,
  "boardProblemId": null,
  "boardAngleId": null,
  "footRuleId": null,
  "mountainRouteId": null,
  "climbTickType": 1,
  "mountaineerTickType": null,
  "isCompleted": true,
  "duration": 120,
  "tryAt": "2026-04-07T10:30:00Z",
  "maxElevationReached": null,
  "weatherConditions": null
}

###

### 8. Registrar intento en board problem
POST {{host}}/api/session/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userSessionId": 1,
  "climbRouteId": null,
  "boardProblemId": 3,
  "boardAngleId": 2,
  "footRuleId": null,
  "mountainRouteId": null,
  "climbTickType": 0,
  "mountaineerTickType": null,
  "isCompleted": false,
  "duration": 45,
  "tryAt": "2026-04-07T11:00:00Z",
  "maxElevationReached": null,
  "weatherConditions": null
}

###

### 9. Obtener progreso de una sesión
GET {{host}}/api/session/{{sessionId}}/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
